{"v":3,"catch":"Gloom and Doom 是一部視覺小說，回歸到 90 年代的一部帶有超自然轉折的懶散電影。","desc":"沮喪的幽靈即將通過獵殺惡魔回到天堂。 在殺死惡魔500年後，他的最後一個印記是那個相信她會導致世界末日的女孩。\n\n但即使是他強大的力量也無法殺死她，他們繼續尋找她的死亡與安寧。\n\n擁有喜怒無常的角色演員陣容和 90 年代的超級英雄漫畫風格，您的選擇將帶您進入七個結局之一。\n\n您是拯救女孩還是拯救世界？","publisher":"SOFT SOURCE","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["冒險","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f153249c7425a1ea1715e06960fe4c1333a5dc4286696903b31bcb015b93faea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dbe01781f8b260244c5c12219b58c2b85506c3487acd97081e698fe34e6b6120.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8a9f68b38b518ddd03203003ea74382c10c6c295950bb7d7eee644695031e5c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d4fa39c86c1870229dd5858379a10903718fc2f4acd3c9e781a3189c9c275b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d9c2fada3ebd85f068a70c8815a72ea791c8c2450c591b004dfde5af5a14fd6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1ee1a5dfc995e716766c5557062f293377a613f0a86bff6f45dc4c8c3d10abb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c7f01584e000","dlc":[]}